abstract: >-
  A reference architecture for an Agentic GraphRAG system
  that combines knowledge graphs with vector search. It features local
  and global search routing, incremental
  ingestion with Louvain community detection and LLM community reports,
  interactive graph visualization, and a complete Azure deployment defined
  in Terraform with a CI/CD pipeline.
